{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brominion is an interactive overlay strategy game. Turn your boring, lifeless desktop screen into an exciting warzone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/SteamBattle2.gif?t=1743132807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your warband:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy minions from the shop, or high-roll them from the slot machine! Train an army of fire-breathing dragons or raise a horde of the undead to destroy your adversaries. Civilly, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/Spell_LevelUp2.png?t=1743132807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn spells:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spells are crucial in turning a battle in your favor. Conjure a fiery Meteor from the heavens, bring down enemy flyers with a deadly Tornado, or melt them down with an Acid Rain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/Chest2.png?t=1743132807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat bosses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn extra rewards when you defeat the bosses. Beware, they are not easy to beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twitch compatibility:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/DesktopOverlay.png?t=1743132807\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/Twitch.png?t=1743132807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brominion is also integrated for live broadcasters on Twitch. In fact, it was designed to add endless hours of interactivity for your Twitch community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the chat, viewers can farm resources to <u>build an army</u>, <u>hunt monsters</u> and even <u>duel other viewers</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipped with fully-customizable UI overlay and game settings, Brominion aims to provide endless hours of fun to any type of stream. Host a session of Brominion for your Twitch community, or play it offline while completing other tasks on your desktop!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505330?t=1743132807","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505330?t=1743132807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/f79c971c9bcd86c5688b12cdb6258979c31dd55f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743132807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/f79c971c9bcd86c5688b12cdb6258979c31dd55f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743132807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brominion is an interactive overlay strategy game. Turn your boring, lifeless desktop screen into an exciting warzone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/SteamBattle2.gif?t=1743132807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your warband:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy minions from the shop, or high-roll them from the slot machine! Train an army of fire-breathing dragons or raise a horde of the undead to destroy your adversaries. Civilly, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/Spell_LevelUp2.png?t=1743132807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn spells:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spells are crucial in turning a battle in your favor. Conjure a fiery Meteor from the heavens, bring down enemy flyers with a deadly Tornado, or melt them down with an Acid Rain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/Chest2.png?t=1743132807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat bosses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn extra rewards when you defeat the bosses. Beware, they are not easy to beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twitch compatibility:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/DesktopOverlay.png?t=1743132807\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/Twitch.png?t=1743132807\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brominion is also integrated for live broadcasters on Twitch. In fact, it was designed to add endless hours of interactivity for your Twitch community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the chat, viewers can farm resources to <u>build an army</u>, <u>hunt monsters</u> and even <u>duel other viewers</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipped with fully-customizable UI overlay and game settings, Brominion aims to provide endless hours of fun to any type of stream. Host a session of Brominion for your Twitch community, or play it offline while completing other tasks on your desktop!</p>","developers":["Hyralism"],"genres":[{"description":"